'''Adventurer Kanna''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Girls & Monsters: Angels of Terror (Gacha Event)|Girls & Monsters: Angels of Terror]] event. She was added in [[Version 10.4 Update|Version 10.4]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.5 Update|Version 11.5]] increases [[Surge Attack|Surge]] level and gains Behemoth Slayer. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 14.1 Update|Version 14.1]].

