==Trivia==
*Unlike other [[Girls & Monsters: Angels of Terror (Gacha Event)|Girls & Monsters]] [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]], there's nothing "monstrous" about Kanna in any of her forms; this is because she was the main protagonist of [[GirlsMons]].
*Prior to [[Version 11.5 Update|Version 11.5]], Kanna's attacks had an effective range of 300~700 on all three hits.
*Adventurer Kanna was the first Uber Rare to gain the Behemoth Slayer ability.
*Kanna's design is possibly based on that of [[Kuu (Uber Rare Cat)|Kuu]]; Their outfits include the same general features, both of them stand on floating platforms to hover above the ground, and their attacks both involve objects crashing down onto enemies in front of them.

